      "purpose": "Origin identity context propagates explicitly."
    }
  ],
  "prose": {
    "summary": "Define propagation of origin identity/assurance context to remote governed resources while requiring the remote instance to evaluate its own AccessCore policy and preventing delegated rights expansion.",
